    "name": "Draw The Way",
    "steam_appid": 577380,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Are you ready to take the ultimate platformer challenge?</strong> </h2>You can draw platforms, shields with your mouse and play the game your own way.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/577380/extras/38a0f8411f9292c57ec3653e69ed32f9.poster.avif?t=1696708953\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/577380/extras/38a0f8411f9292c57ec3653e69ed32f9.webm?t=1696708953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/577380/extras/38a0f8411f9292c57ec3653e69ed32f9.mp4?t=1696708953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>With the &quot;<strong>time freeze flashlight</strong>&quot; you can freeze time to stop harmful projectiles and traps.<br><strong>Team up</strong> with a friend in one of the two coop modes, including full-coop mode where one player draws and the other freezes time.<br><br>Choose from a variety of <strong>unique characters</strong>, each with their own special abilities!<br>Whether you play solo or coop, the challenge will test your limits and push you to your max.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Nightmare difficulty - you can try, but you will cry!</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/577380/extras/2300dd44aef89a08c653fcd6908287cc.poster.avif?t=1696708953\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/577380/extras/2300dd44aef89a08c653fcd6908287cc.webm?t=1696708953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/577380/extras/2300dd44aef89a08c653fcd6908287cc.mp4?t=1696708953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Are you ready to take on the ultimate platformer challenge?<br>Then step up and prove your skills in this thrilling game today!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Coop multiplayer! Play with your friend and cooperate or just try to beat their score!<br></li><li>Unique drawing tool, draw anything! - Like a platform to jump on or a shield to protect you from the harmful projectiles. <br></li><li>Time Freeze flashlight, which can save you from tight situations. <br></li><li>Challenging maps and difficulties. <br></li><li>Nightmare mode for the ultimate challengers.<br></li><li>Several unlockable heroes wich unique abilities.<br></li><li>Hardcore and fast-paced gameplay.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Are you ready to take the ultimate platformer challenge?</strong> </h2>You can draw platforms, shields with your mouse and play the game your own way.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/577380/extras/38a0f8411f9292c57ec3653e69ed32f9.poster.avif?t=1696708953\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/577380/extras/38a0f8411f9292c57ec3653e69ed32f9.webm?t=1696708953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/577380/extras/38a0f8411f9292c57ec3653e69ed32f9.mp4?t=1696708953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>With the &quot;<strong>time freeze flashlight</strong>&quot; you can freeze time to stop harmful projectiles and traps.<br><strong>Team up</strong> with a friend in one of the two coop modes, including full-coop mode where one player draws and the other freezes time.<br><br>Choose from a variety of <strong>unique characters</strong>, each with their own special abilities!<br>Whether you play solo or coop, the challenge will test your limits and push you to your max.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Nightmare difficulty - you can try, but you will cry!</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/577380/extras/2300dd44aef89a08c653fcd6908287cc.poster.avif?t=1696708953\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/577380/extras/2300dd44aef89a08c653fcd6908287cc.webm?t=1696708953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/577380/extras/2300dd44aef89a08c653fcd6908287cc.mp4?t=1696708953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Are you ready to take on the ultimate platformer challenge?<br>Then step up and prove your skills in this thrilling game today!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Coop multiplayer! Play with your friend and cooperate or just try to beat their score!<br></li><li>Unique drawing tool, draw anything! - Like a platform to jump on or a shield to protect you from the harmful projectiles. <br></li><li>Time Freeze flashlight, which can save you from tight situations. <br></li><li>Challenging maps and difficulties. <br></li><li>Nightmare mode for the ultimate challengers.<br></li><li>Several unlockable heroes wich unique abilities.<br></li><li>Hardcore and fast-paced gameplay.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Draw The Way is a hardcore platforming game. Draw your platforms and shields with your mouse. Choose from different heroes and play solo or team up with a friend.. either way it won't be easy! So.. are you up for the challenge?",
